WSIAT is your **best chance** to overturn an unfair WSIB decision. With a **68.7% success rate**, appeals are frequently successful when proper evidence is presented.

**Key Takeaways:**
1. File within 6 months deadline
2. Get independent medical evidence
3. Build comprehensive documentary record
4. Consider free OWA representation
5. Prepare thoroughly for hearing
6. Don't give up - odds are in your favor

